  "body": "https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.1#get-matrix-client-r0-thirdparty-protocols does not sufficiently describe the shape of the response, it tells you about the various types within it but not that the response is a `Map<string, Protocol>` nor that `field_types` is of type `Map<string, FieldType>`\r\n\r\n`ProtocolInstance` also does not document the `instance_id` field which Synapse emits and Element depends on.\r\nhttps://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.6.1#post-matrix-client-r0-publicrooms seems to also depend on it for the `third_party_instance_id` field.",
